cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the associated paper."
type: software
title: "HMA Glacier Mass Balance Attribution: XGBoost-SHAP Framework"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rumi27/hma-smb-attribution"
abstract: >
  Code and derived data for XGBoost-SHAP attribution of High Mountain Asia
  glacier surface mass balance drivers. Includes spatial cross-validation,
  SHAP feature importance, sensitivity analyses, and CMIP6 projections
  for ~94,000 glaciers across 15 sub-regions. Revised version adds Random
  Forest SHAP and permutation importance comparison (Table S3), size-stratified
  cross-validation statistics, and supplementary descriptive statistics.

